Package: libuniscript-dev
Source: uniscript
Version: @VERSION@
Architecture: @ARCH@
Maintainer: pannous <info@pannous.com>
Installed-Size: @SIZE@
Depends: libuniscript1 (= @VERSION@)
Section: libdevel
Priority: optional
Multi-Arch: same
Homepage: https://pannous.com/uniscript/
Description: ASCII names for Unicode text and back - development files
 uniscript converts tags like <:alpha> or <:fracture A> into the Unicode text
 they name and Unicode text back into tags.
 .
 This package contains the C header uniscript.h, the C++17 header uniscript.hpp,
 the CMake package uniscript::uniscript and the pkg-config file uniscript.pc.
